{"id":"n70811-1-8","stage":1,"title":"맛있다 · 好吃","scene":"餐饮与生活","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n70811-1-8-1","ko":"소리가 아주 맛있게 들리는데요?","zh":"听起来味道真不错呢！","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"소리가","meaning":"嗓音，嗓子，嗓门","explanation":"소리：嗓音，嗓子，嗓门；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"소리","audio":"/audio/d13cec79f66edb6aa0c5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62379","senseId":"3","lemma":"소리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아주","meaning":"非常，极其，很","explanation":"아주：非常，极其，很","readings":[{"term":"아주","audio":"/audio/dc76f888ddfaef286adb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72484","senseId":"1","lemma":"아주","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"맛있게","meaning":"好吃，可口，香","explanation":"맛있다：好吃，可口，香；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"맛있다","audio":"/audio/21e91ac8a208ff9e520a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70811","senseId":"1","lemma":"맛있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"들리는데요?","meaning":"听到，传来","explanation":"들리다：听到，传来；는데요：礼貌地交代背景、感想或含蓄的对照。","readings":[{"term":"들리다","audio":"/audio/f5d8f68f409d3cd71df1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70783","senseId":"1","lemma":"들리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"d13cec79f66edb6a","term":"소리","zh":"嗓音，嗓子，嗓门","audio":"/audio/d13cec79f66edb6aa0c5.mp3","entryId":"62379","definition":"从人的喉咙发出的声音。","pronunciation":["소리"]},{"id":"dc76f888ddfaef28","term":"아주","zh":"非常，极其，很","audio":"/audio/dc76f888ddfaef286adb.mp3","entryId":"72484","definition":"表示程度相当高，远远超出了一般程度。","pronunciation":["아주"]},{"id":"21e91ac8a208ff9e","term":"맛있다","zh":"好吃，可口，香","audio":"/audio/21e91ac8a208ff9e520a.mp3","entryId":"70811","definition":"食物的味道好。","pronunciation":["마딛따","마싣따"]},{"id":"f5d8f68f409d3cd7","term":"들리다","zh":"听到，传来","audio":"/audio/f5d8f68f409d3cd71df1.mp3","entryId":"70783","definition":"通过耳朵接受声音。","pronunciation":["들리다"]}],"audio":"/audio/0b7cfa4eba8619b2d78a.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n70811-1-8-2","ko":"드셔 보시면 실제로도 맛이 좋을 거예요.","zh":"尝一尝的话，实际味道应该也会很好吃的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"드셔","meaning":"用餐、吃或喝（敬语）","explanation":"들다：用餐、吃或喝（敬语）；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"들다","audio":"/audio/7ff37822e89462ea5014.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57293","senseId":"3","lemma":"들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"보시면","meaning":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","explanation":"보다：试着做（-아/어 보다）；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"8","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"실제로도","meaning":"实际","explanation":"실제로：实际；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"실제로","audio":"/audio/0f0e8385804d6e401988.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14112","senseId":"1","lemma":"실제로","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"맛이","meaning":"味，味道","explanation":"맛：味，味道；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"맛","audio":"/audio/2bc64d401ca15bdf9987.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66228","senseId":"1","lemma":"맛","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좋을","meaning":"好，美，优良，优美","explanation":"좋다：好，美，优良，优美；을：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"1","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"거예요.","meaning":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","explanation":"거：表示说话人的推测或信念等。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；예요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"5","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"7ff37822e89462ea","term":"들다","zh":"用餐、吃或喝（敬语）","audio":"/audio/7ff37822e89462ea5014.mp3","entryId":"57293","definition":"(尊称)吃。","pronunciation":["들다"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"0f0e8385804d6e40","term":"실제로","zh":"实际","audio":"/audio/0f0e8385804d6e401988.mp3","entryId":"14112","definition":"现实中真的，而不是假的或想象的。","pronunciation":["실쩨로"]},{"id":"2bc64d401ca15bdf","term":"맛","zh":"味，味道","audio":"/audio/2bc64d401ca15bdf9987.mp3","entryId":"66228","definition":"用舌头接触食物等时得到的感觉。","pronunciation":["맏"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"好，美，优良，优美","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"性质或内容等很优秀，让人满意。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/ddba91c7c1e582f1eeb4.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.398,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=70811","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":32,"sequenceScore":1.4054,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["尝一尝的话，实际味道应该也会很好吃的。","你的手也太凉了。","听起来味道真不错呢！"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["尝一尝的话，实际味道应该也会很好吃的。","听起来味道真不错呢！","你的手也太凉了。"],"answer":0}]}
